				"locked": false,
				"title": "fix(web): prevent flash of incorrect workspace tasks on load",
				"body": "# Pull Request\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\n_Summary_\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a bug where tasks from a previously viewed workspace briefly appeared before the correct tasks loaded.\r\n\r\n_What was the issue_\r\n\r\nWhen switching between workspaces (teams), React Query served cached task data from the previously viewed team, resulting in a temporary flash of incorrect tasks until the new data was fetched and rendered.\r\n\r\n_What was the fix_\r\n\r\nTo prevent this, now:\r\n\tImmediately clear tasks when a team change is detected.\r\n\tInvalidate and remove queries for the previously selected team to ensure stale task data is cleared before new data is loaded.\r\nThis change ensures users only see tasks relevant to their current workspace, improving data accuracy and preventing confusion caused by flashing outdated task data.\r\n\r\nTicket (ticket)\r\n\r\nSQU-610\r\n\r\n## Type of change\r\n\r\n- [x] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\r\n- [x] Refactoring (non-breaking change which refactors old code)\r\n- [ ] Design (Affects styling or design components)\r\n- [ ] Documentation (Improvements or additions to documentation)\r\n\r\n## How Has This Been Tested?\r\n\r\nPlease describe the tests that you ran to verify your changes. Provide instructions so we can reproduce.\r\n\r\n- [x] Manually tested switching between different workspaces/teams.\r\n- [x] Verified that no incorrect tasks briefly appear during transition.\r\n- [x] Confirmed only the current team’s tasks are shown after switching.\r\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai --\u003e\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **Bug Fixes**\n  - Improved data freshness and cache invalidation when switching teams on the task dashboard.\n  - Prevented display of outdated or stale task data after changing teams.\n  - Enhanced loading state handling to avoid premature rendering when team information is not fully loaded.\n\n\u003c!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai --\u003e\n\n",
